{"id":"vod_bf_4972","vodId":"4972","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"虫王战队超王者","name_cn":"虫王战队超王者","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全50集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-6/2040ba11d552c96f4c26b0768d4ab689.jpg"},"summary":"这是史上第一个昆虫主题的超级战队！5位国王和昆虫机器人，描绘了前所未有的幻想大作。本作的重点是5位英雄全员都是国王！　　他们挺身对抗袭击地球人的“敌人・地帝国虫纳洛克” 。国王英雄们拿着作为王者证明的变身剑“王者圣剑” 和变形盾“君王武装”，乘坐名为“君王者”的机器人与敌人战斗。　　而守护着五名英雄并一同与敌人战斗的是“昆虫形机器人”。　　本作的机器人是昆虫型机械生命体“守护神”！ 它们是曾经保护过“地球”的守护神，国王们通过“王者圣剑” 与守护神维持沟通并借此长久守护着各自的国家。　　并且当“神瓢虫”、“神蜘蛛”、“神蚂蚁”与守护神们合体后，国王们乘坐的最强机器人“君王者”诞生！ 敬请期待这些强大又艳丽的昆虫机器人们！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,奇幻,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-02-25 20:35:02","episodeCount":50,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/chongwangzhanduichaowangzhe